WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.372 --> 00:00:14.315
Once, an old woman lived with her son and his wife.

2
00:00:16.517 --> 00:00:20.120
The woman was blind, and the family was very poor.

3
00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:26.565
Yet each day the old woman prayed to a god.

4
00:00:28.707 --> 00:00:32.963
Then, one morning, that god himself appeared before her.

5
00:00:32.983 --> 00:00:36.866
"Old woman, you are thoughtful and kind.

6
00:00:38.447 --> 00:00:40.129
You pray every day.

7
00:00:41.951 --> 00:00:44.173
I would like to reward this goodness.

8
00:00:44.573 --> 00:00:46.935
So I have decided to grant you a wish."

9
00:00:46.955 --> 00:00:53.661
"What?" The old woman couldn't believe what she was hearing.

10
00:00:53.681 --> 00:00:56.784
