11
00:00:58.212 --> 00:01:00.174
"I don't know what to wish for."

12
00:01:00.194 --> 00:01:03.797
"I understand," the god said.

13
00:01:03.817 --> 00:01:07.961
"Talk to your son and his wife.

14
00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:11.344
Surely they can help you decide what to choose.

15
00:01:11.724 --> 00:01:13.165
I will return tomorrow."

16
00:01:17.148 --> 00:01:19.290
The old woman hurried to her son.

17
00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:21.412
"A god came to me.

18
00:01:21.432 --> 00:01:23.914
He said He will grant me one wish.

19
00:01:24.154 --> 00:01:25.696
But what should I ask for?"

20
00:01:26.908 --> 00:01:28.750
The son's face lit up.

21
00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:31.812
"Our roof is leaking, and our clothes are thin.

22
00:01:32.653 --> 00:01:33.874
Our rice pot is empty.

23
00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:36.396
Mother, you must ask for wealth!"

24
00:01:36.416 --> 00:01:42.361
"Hmm." The old woman nodded slowly.

25
