26
00:01:48.766 --> 00:01:50.708
"A god came to me.

27
00:01:51.088 --> 00:01:53.290
He said He will grant me one wish.

28
00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:55.652
But what should I ask for?"

29
00:01:57.372 --> 00:01:59.473
The younger woman's face lit up.

30
00:01:59.493 --> 00:02:04.056
"You must ask for a baby—a beautiful grandson!"

31
00:02:04.076 --> 00:02:11.059
"Hmm." The old woman nodded slowly, but she still felt unsure.

32
00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.421
She went to visit a neighbor.

33
00:02:14.441 --> 00:02:18.283
"A god says He will grant me one wish.

34
00:02:18.804 --> 00:02:20.505
But what should I ask for?"

35
00:02:20.525 --> 00:02:23.806
The neighbor laughed.

36
00:02:23.826 --> 00:02:26.588
"Why, you must ask Him for sight, of course.

37
00:02:27.612 --> 00:02:28.312
Just think!

38
00:02:30.053 --> 00:02:32.553
You could see the blue sky and tall mountains again."

39
