46
00:03:07.916 --> 00:03:10.438
The next morning the god appeared.

47
00:03:10.458 --> 00:03:13.560
"Well, old woman, it's time.

48
00:03:14.321 --> 00:03:15.522
What is your wish?"

49
00:03:20.105 --> 00:03:22.006
The old woman took a deep breath.

50
00:03:22.747 --> 00:03:23.968
She was ready.

51
00:03:24.992 --> 00:03:31.154
"I wish to see my grandson drinking milk from a golden bowl."

52
00:03:31.174 --> 00:03:36.795
"What?" The god laughed loudly.

53
00:03:36.815 --> 00:03:38.776
"You clever old woman!

